# Dialogue tree: a node sheet (nodes) and a choice child sheet (nodes.choices). next is a ref(node) pointing at another node.
# A choice row names its parent node in the ^ column; a choice without next ends the conversation.
@ref node = #nodes.id label=text
@doc nodes.next = Node that follows when this one has no choices
@doc nodes.choices.next = Node reached by this choice (empty ends the conversation)

@sheet nodes key=id
id:str   | speaker:str | text:str                             | next:ref(node)?
greet    | Mara        | Welcome to Mossveil. Need something? |
work     | Mara        | Slimes are fouling the well. Care to help? |
accepted | Mara        | Bless you. Bring me the gel when you can. | farewell
shop     | Mara        | Browse as you like.                  | greet
farewell | Mara        | Safe roads, traveler.                |

@sheet nodes.choices
^     | text:str              | next:ref(node)?
greet | Any work for me?      | work
greet | Let me see your wares | shop
greet | Never mind.           |
work  | I'll do it.           | accepted
work  | Not right now.        | greet
